WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.470
Early autumn is approaching.

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:20.720
The hot days will still continue,
but once the sun goes down...

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.440
The gentle breeze that makes
the bush clovers sway feels nice,

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:29.320
and I can sit here out on the porch
enjoying some tea and...

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:32.150
Koi! We ran away from home!

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:34.150
Welp, that's ruined.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:52.710
<i>I had dropped something important</i>
<i>and even though I didn't know you,</i>

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:58.260
<i>You had found it and brought it back</i>
<i>to me unexpectedly this morning</i>

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:04.020
<i>Oh yeah, I was always told to</i>
<i>write my name on important things</i>

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:09.770
<i>Or I might end up losing them somewhere</i>

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>It's not (anyone's fault)</i>

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:15.450
<i>It's not (like it belongs to anyone else)</i>

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:20.660
<i>The world will always be right there</i>

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:23.370
<i>Let the wind (take you by the hand)</i>

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:26.160
<i>And the sky (now, breathe together)</i>

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:28.830
<i>And let's go (it's now begun to move)</i>

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:32.000
<i>The arrow in our hearts</i>

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.920
<i>If I'm (yes, if I'm with you)</i>

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:38.300
<i>With you (yes, because I'm with you)</i>

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:48.480
<i>We still don't know what's going to</i>
<i>happen in this future that's moving forward</i>

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:53.190
<i>And bouncing glitteringly</i>

