"Episode 9"
"I Wanna Go on a Fishing
and Camping Trip!!"

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:13.090
So... Why'd you run away?

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:14.630
Well...

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:19.680
After discussing what's really important
to us, it caused a rift in our family.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:20.800
What?

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:25.560
