00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:30.600
We want to go on a fishing
and camping trip on our own.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:32.610
Absolutely not.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:36.690
B-But we have enough money
from our part-time jobs!

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:38.610
This isn't about money.

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:42.070
I'm telling you no because it's too
dangerous for kids to go camping alone.

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:45.450
