00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:47.910
Exactly. You're still in high school.

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:49.580
You know...

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:53.290
I went on a trip with my friends
when I was in high school.

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:53.590
--Huh?!

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:54.340
--How nostalgic.
--Huh?!

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.000
--How nostalgic.
--Does that mean we can go?!

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.470
Sure, I'm fine with it.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:02:59.340
Wha--

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.470
