00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:04.220
Meaning majority rules! Problem solved!

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:08.850
That's not how this is going to work!

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:13.860
You ended up with a fever the
other day when you went to the stream.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:16.190
What are you going to do
if that happens again?

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:19.320
