I forgot my rain gear.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:21.030
My fever went away quickly, too.

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:22.570
Come on, please?

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:23.870
Absolutely not.

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.620
I'll make sure I won't get sick!

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:26.450
No.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:27.660
I'll get better grades!

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:28.540
No.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:31.000
I'll make everything you
like for dinner for a while!

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.000
No!

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.080
Ugh!

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.090
--Um--
--Anyway,

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:39.550
it's too dangerous for you girls to go
on a trip alone, so I will not allow it.

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:48.470
Daddy, you blockhead!

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:51.690
That's why you ran away?
So you are a child.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:55.400
--No fair! No fair!
--I am not a child! I look like an
adult and I'm smart like one, too!

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:55.860
--Big Brother, me too! Me, too!
--I am not a child! I look like an
adult and I'm smart like one, too!

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.650
--Big Brother, me too! Me, too!
--But what brought this on?

00:03:57.650 --> 00:03:58.070
--Big Brother, more!
--But what brought this on?

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:01.110
--Big Brother, more!
--We were supposed to go
on a trip in autumn.

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:03.150
Well...

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:07.280
Ever since she heard that Hayato
went on a camping trip with his friends

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:09.410
